  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Defect 1 — blank identifier (fixed)",
      "items": [
        "The guard asked whether MerchantIdentifier was non-null, and an empty string passes that test",
        "From 2026-08-04 the upstream card feed sent empty strings, so every card refund took the skip branch",
        "64 of the 71 completed misses came through here, and it leaves a SkipFloatUpdate history row"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Defect 2 — aggregating merchant (open)",
      "items": [
        "For an aggregating merchant with enough balance the balance result comes back without a FloatId",
        "Validation still succeeds, so the deduction is skipped with no history row and no log line",
        "Only Homefind24 qualifies today, and it remains actively aggregating"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Why the order matters now",
      "items": [
        "Before the fix, defect 1 short-circuited ahead of defect 2 and hid it",
        "Blank identifiers now continue into the balance path, where defect 2 waits",
        "Defect 2 is the more dangerous of the two because it leaves no audit trail at all"
      ]
    }
  ]
